# Halcyon's leaders: the research director at the lab and the field leads.
# Voice: precise, a bit cold, sometimes guilty. Humour only by accident: exact words that land wrong.

conv halcyon.leader.beaks
for stronghold:halcyon, seat:halcyon/field_lead
topic "Ask why they call you the beaks."
prio flavour
voice halcyon

node start
  say "The respirators. Long filters. From a distance we look like birds, apparently, or plague doctors."
  say "Someone stencilled a plague doctor on a sample case as a joke. It is now on every case, door and van."
  > @scrub "Why not scrub it off?" -> scrub
  > @notebook "You still keep a notebook each?" -> notebook   if bg:labtech,doctor,nurse
  > @other "Something else." -> hub

node scrub
  say "Nobody could think of a reason that was worth the solvent. We are short of solvent."
  say "Also, people move out of our way. That has value."
  > @back1 "Something else." -> hub

node notebook
  say "Numbered. Every reading, every sample, every volunteer. When one of us dies, the notebook belongs to the lab."
  say "We read it into the record, page by page. It takes longer than the funeral."
  do learn:halcyon.notebooks
  > @back2 "Something else." -> hub

conv halcyon.leader.numbers
for stronghold:halcyon, seat:halcyon/field_lead
when !epilogue
topic "Ask how close the cure is."
prio world
voice halcyon

node start
  say "The number this morning was {cure_percent} percent. I wouldn't repeat it to anyone with a gun."
  say "Eight in ten walk out of the trial dose. We write down the other two."
  > @two "Who sits with the other two?" -> two
  > @help "What would speed it up?" -> help
  > @other3 "Something else." -> hub

node two
  say "Someone with a clipboard. Somebody has to, and they should be counted."
  say "It isn't a good job. It's a necessary one. Those aren't the same, and I've stopped pretending they are."
  > @back3 "Something else." -> hub

node help
  say "Samples. Live tissue from the big ones, cold and labelled. And time, which nobody can bring us."
  say? need:samples :: "We are short this week. The field leads will pay for anything usable."
  say "Ask the quartermaster what pays. I don't handle money. I handle consequences."
  > @back4 "Something else." -> hub

# A field lead who hides the other two: the lie, and the truth that opens a better answer
# (the Doctor wanderer says it too: dialogue/wanderers/lies.rzd).
conv halcyon.lead.volunteers
for seat:halcyon/field_lead
when cure>=25
topic "Ask about the volunteers."
prio world
voice halcyon

node start
  say "Eight in ten walk out of the trial. We write down the other two. They're in the record."
  > @where "Where are the other two now?" -> deflect
  > @sheets "Ten went in. Your beds say eight." -> back_room   if bg:labtech,doctor
  > @catch "There's a room at the back. I know." -> back_room   callout halcyon.back_room
  > @leave "That's enough for me." -> hub

node deflect
  say "Somewhere quiet. They're comfortable. Ask me something else." ~lie:halcyon.back_room
  > @show "Show me." -> back_room | refused   check persuade halcyon 3 bg:labtech,doctor
  > @drop "Something else, then." -> hub

node refused
  say "No. And if you're from the houses, tell them we're sorry. We are."
  > @yourself "Tell them yourself." -> start
  > @drop2 "Something else." -> hub

node back_room
  say "There's a room at the back. Someone sits with them, with a clipboard. It's the protocol, and I hate it." ~truth:halcyon.back_room
  > @back1 "Something else." -> hub
